NNAAMMEE
       pgmtoppm - colorize a PGM (grayscale) image into a PPM (color) image


SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
       ppggmmttooppppmm [--bbllaacckk==_c_o_l_o_r_s_p_e_c_1] [--wwhhiittee==_c_o_l_o_r_s_p_e_c_2]
        [_p_g_m_f_i_l_e]  ppggmmttooppppmm  --mmaapp==_f_i_l_e_n_a_m_e  [_p_g_m_f_i_l_e] ppggmmttooppppmm _c_o_l_o_r_s_p_e_c [_p_g_m_‐
       _f_i_l_e] ppggmmttooppppmm _c_o_l_o_r_s_p_e_c_1--_c_o_l_o_r_s_p_e_c_2 [_p_g_m_f_i_l_e]

